  },
  "section": "10.36",
  "rulesText": "Magic items are presented in alphabetical order.\n\nIf a magic item description capitalizes a creature's name and presents it in bold type, that's a visual cue pointing you to the creature's stat block. Unless the text states otherwise, the stat block is in “Monsters.” How to read and use a stat block is explained in “Monsters.”"
}
